### 1. Health / Info Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api

### 2. Create Student (POST)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNo": "101",
  "name": "Aditya Aushikar",
  "email": "aditya@university.edu",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "marks": 92
}

### 3. Get All Students (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/students

### 4. Get Student by Roll Number or ID (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/students/101

### 5. Update Student (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/students/101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marks": 98,
  "department": "Information Technology"
}

### 6. Delete Student (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/students/101
